            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {},
          "name": "Heading"
        },
        "text_seo_body_1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>OTIS Rx lenses are made to your script and finished with scratch-resistant, anti-reflective and UV-protective coatings as standard. Everyday Clarity CR-39 lenses suit our acetate frames and everyday wear; Active Protection polycarbonate lenses are built for 6-base sun frames and impact resistance. Both are available clear, polarized or as Transitions, in standard and high Rx powers. No lens is scratch proof, but the coatings we use hold up to daily wear.</p>",
            "width": "100%",
            "max_width": "normal",
            "alignment": "left",
            "type_preset": "rte",
            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "font_size": "1rem",
            "line_height": "normal",
            "letter_spacing": "normal",
            "case": "none",
            "wrap": "pretty",
            "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
            "background": false,
            "background_color": "#00000026",
            "corner_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {},
          "name": "Body"
        },
        "text_seo_body_2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Sustainability runs through the collection too. Our Eco Acetate frames are certified biodegradable at the end of their life, and we work with our suppliers to keep materials responsibly sourced. Browse the <a href=\"/collections/mens-eyewear\" title=\"Men’s eyewear\">men’s</a> and <a href=\"/collections/womens-eyewear\" title=\"Women’s eyewear\">women’s</a> ranges to find a frame that suits you, then build it with the lenses you need.</p>",
            "width": "100%",
            "max_width": "normal",
            "alignment": "left",
            "type_preset": "rte",
            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "font_size": "1rem",
            "line_height": "normal",
            "letter_spacing": "normal",
            "case": "none",
            "wrap": "pretty",
            "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
            "background": false,
            "background_color": "#00000026",
            "corner_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {},
          "name": "Body"
        }
